# Write (docs/38): the title and the formula draw themselves in, letter by
# letter: first the outline, then the fill, each letter a little after the
# one before (like Manim's Write).

scene "write"
title "Newton's gravity" 0s-20s write 1.5s
math "F = G\frac{m_1 m_2}{r^2}" 1s-20s write 2s

sun    = sphere big gold important label math "m_1" always
planet = octahedron red orbits sun 1 turn 0s-20s label math "m_2" always
arrow sun planet gold
